.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH diff 1  "diff " 
.SH NAME
diff \- Unified diff of a local snippet against the cloud latest
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdiff\fR [\fB\-\-registry\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Unified diff of a local snippet against the cloud latest
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-registry\fR \fI<REGISTRY>\fR
Registry base URL (default: `FORGEHUB_REGISTRY` or config)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
Local snippet name
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  fg diff ubuntu\-setup
